== Picking the Right Race ==

When creating a character you must first select your primary race.  This race will be locked in at character creation, and can't be changed until you unlock other races.  Below are the race options for this class, as well as their corresponding stat distribution.

In Everquest Legends, choosing to add Rogue to your class combination (whether as your Primary Class or otherwise) grants the following stat modifiers:

*+15 AGI
*+15 DEX

When selecting a race, key factors include its associated and opposed factions, as well as any racial benefits or penalties. Click the race's name to visit its detailed page for a full breakdown of these elements.

